{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/435","id":4473669585,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSpI5QM8AAAABCqbH0Q","html_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/435","diff_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/435.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/435.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/issues/435","number":435,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Reject unknown-time references outside the selected local date","user":{"login":"zodiacs-org","id":289121529,"node_id":"U_kgDOETuk-Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289121529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org","html_url":"https://github.com/zodiacs-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Unknown-time birth charts and city-based Moon lookups could calculate a local-noon reference that falls on another local date, including historically skipped dates. Check that the selected instant belongs to the requested Gregorian date before numerical, receipt or endpoint work. If membership is false or unavailable, show the dedicated error in all six languages, preserve the entered fields, and use the existing focused retry behavior.\n\nThis is a selected-instant safeguard. Refusal does not prove the date is empty: the retained complete synthetic transition example has a nonempty nine-hour date whose current noon reference falls outside it. A successful check does not establish whole-date Sun/Moon coverage or certainty. Known-time gap handling, no-city UTC Moon and positions-only imports keep their existing behavior. No native Temporal requirement, polyfill, provider, alternative reference, dependency, engine/SDK/API or account change is introduced.\n\nScope: nine product files, five tests/drivers and two metadata files. The original independently reviewed 12-file freeze is unchanged. Two existing catalog tests update only their exact 418→419 count and matching title; key-parity and interpolation assertions remain intact. The exact-base allowance's six catalogs plus those two test paths have separate independent acceptance. CI adds one four-line native step using existing Node22/Chromium, permissions and artifact policy. Styles, global navigation, root guides, canonical Registry/disclosures and Astrofolio are untouched.\n\nValidation:\n- Root normal build/check pass: 1,044 files, zero errors/warnings. All 5,024 tests in 417 files pass. Existing bundle budgets pass; engine remains 23.3KB/25KB.\n- Root native gates pass 35 date, 20 Moon ownership and 17 chart ownership cases. Independent review accepts 26 caller criteria, nine exact numerical-output comparisons and 92 helper controls on each Node22/24/native Chrome. These finite cases are not a general astronomical-accuracy or date-completeness claim.\n- All 18 fresh approved-page captures are byte-identical to the base. Actual normal pages pass 24 locale/tool/width cases: 12 Moon cases initially, plus 12 affected chart cases after correcting the harness's error-on-edit assumption. Chart keeps its old error until retry; product source was unchanged. Original failures remain retained.\n- Independent combined actual-page acceptance verifies a seeded signed-in chart/pending panel → real offline Apia skipped-date refusal with old output/actions/context/panel cleared → valid-date recovery. Preference reads are 1→1→2; profile bytes remain unchanged. One pre-existing startup sync POST is locally blocked; the measured flow attempts zero additional mutations. No real backend write or authentication enforcement is claimed.\n\nStacked on #434 exact3845a04bcea822da3c30a18848ef3d8d133b7b66. Current source f803d2543ad81343b22d49326b8b46d0e2ea03a0. Durable source identities, original failures, independent reviews and root raw evidence: docs/platform/evidence/local-date-reference/; shared checkpoint: docs/platform/STATUS.md.\n\nDraft delivery only. Exact-source hosted CI and preview are pending. No merge, npm publication, production deployment, human numerical/legal signoff or external adoption. SDK #5's hold and the separately owned Astrofolio verification release remain intact. Historical endpoint/certainty counterexamples remain a distinct next requirement; this safeguard does not conceal them.\n","created_at":"2026-09-08T11:23:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T11:24:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"53f2a1ee13db911e83bda79c4dafe8bcb8a41ee8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/435/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/435/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/issues/435/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/statuses/f803d2543ad81343b22d49326b8b46d0e2ea03a0","head":{"label":"ZodiacsOfficial:codex/platform-local-date-reference","ref":"codex/platform-local-date-reference","sha":"f803d2543ad81343b22d49326b8b46d0e2ea03a0","user":{"login":"ZodiacsOfficial","id":289132375,"node_id":"O_kgDOETvPVw","avatar_url":"https://a